actual:
To attach an inline keyboard, include the `reply_markup` parameter in your JSON payload for the `sendMessage` request. Here is an example structure:

```json
{
  "chat_id": "123456",
  "text": "Please review this request:",
  "reply_markup": {
    "inline_keyboard": [
      [
        { "text": "Accept", "callback_data": "action_accept" },
        { "text": "Reject", "callback_data": "action_reject" }
      ]
    ]
  }
}
```
Pass this object as JSON when calling the `sendMessage` endpoint.
